Description: local model inference daemon and command-line client
 TLlama serves Ollama-compatible and OpenAI-compatible inference APIs using
 private native tllama-server workers. It manages model definitions, model
 storage, accelerator selection and worker lifetimes.
 .
 This package provides the tllamad foreground daemon, its systemd service and
 server configuration, and the tllama client with an interactive prompt.
 Native inference backends are supplied by separate tllama-server packages.
